WEBVTT

00:06:25.214 --> 00:06:31.053
Now they are using their own resources

00:06:31.053 --> 00:06:35.850
to fulfill their own needs
when they need it.

00:06:36.267 --> 00:06:38.561
This is self-reliance.

00:06:39.270 --> 00:06:45.734
(Applause and cheers)

00:06:47.069 --> 00:06:51.824
So how have we enabled the use of goats

00:06:51.824 --> 00:06:54.493
as a reliable form of currency?

00:06:55.161 --> 00:07:00.624
Right now, we we work with farmers
through physical barter.